function PipelineCard({active,progress}){const live=!!progress&&!progress.simulated;const [step,setStep]=useState(0);useEffect(()=>{if(!active||live){setStep(0);return}const id=setInterval(()=>setStep(s=>Math.min(s+1,pipeline.length)),650);return()=>clearInterval(id)},[active,live]);const rowState=i=>{if(!live)return {done:i<step-1,working:active&&i===step-1};const st=i===0?{status:'done',message:'Upload validated and decoded'}:progress.stages?.find(s=>s.name===STAGE_FOR_ROW[i]);const done=!!st&&!['waiting','running'].includes(st.status);return {done,working:st?.status==='running',note:done?(st.status==='done'?(st.message||'Stage complete'):`${STAGE_NOTE[st.status]||st.status}${st.message?` · ${st.message}`:''}`):null}};const pct=live?progress.percent:Math.min(100,Math.round(step/pipeline.length*100));return <Card className="pipeline-card"><div className="pipeline-title"><div><span className="step-label">02 <span>WORKFLOW</span></span><h2>Analysis pipeline</h2></div><Badge tone={active?'processing':'soft'}>{active?'PROCESSING':live?progress.status.replaceAll('_',' '):'STANDING BY'}</Badge></div><div className="pipeline-list">{pipeline.map(([name,Icon,desc],i)=>{const {done,working,note}=rowState(i);return <div className={`pipeline-row ${done?'done':''} ${working?'working':''}`} key={name}><div className="pipeline-node"><Icon size={15}/></div><div className="pipeline-row-copy"><b>{name}</b><small title={note||undefined}>{done?(note||'Stage complete'):working?desc:'Waiting'}</small></div><span className="pipeline-state">{done?<Check size={14}/>:working?<span className="spinner"/>:<span className="waiting-dot"/>}</span></div>})}</div><div className="pipeline-foot"><span>{live?'Live backend pipeline':'Prototype pipeline'}</span><span>{live||step?`${pct}%`:'—'}</span></div><div className="progress-track"><i style={{width:`${pct}%`}}/></div></Card>}
function ResultsPage({result,setPage}){const [query,setQuery]=useState(''),[copied,setCopied]=useState(false),[expanded,setExpanded]=useState(true);const data=result||simulatedResult();const sim=data.simulated;const transcript=data.transcript.lines.filter(x=>x.text.toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()));const norm=w=>w.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z]/g,'');const highlight=(u,word,j)=>{const w=norm(word);if(sim)return w==='um'||w==='to'&&u.flag==='Repetition';const ws=u.text.split(' ');return FILLER_WORDS.has(w)||(j>0&&w!==''&&w===norm(ws[j-1]))};return <div className="page results-page"><div className="page-title-row"><div><div className="eyebrow">ANALYSIS <span className="slash">/</span> {data.id}</div><h1>Speech analysis</h1><p>{sim?'Research-oriented speech features and a simulated severity estimate.':'Research-oriented speech features computed by the live research backend.'}</p></div><div className="title-actions"><ModeBadge simulated={sim}/><Button variant="secondary" icon={FileText} onClick={()=>setPage('Reports')}>View report</Button></div></div><div className="result-summary"><PredictionCard data={data}/><Card className="result-meta-card"><div className="meta-card-top"><MiniMark/><div><span className="section-kicker">SAMPLE SUMMARY</span><h3>{data.filename||'research-sample.wav'}</h3></div><IconButton label="More sample options"><MoreHorizontal size={17}/></IconButton></div><div className="meta-grid"><div><small>ANALYSIS ID</small><b>{data.id}</b></div><div><small>DURATION</small><b>{data.duration}</b></div><div><small>ANALYZED</small><b>{data.analyzedLabel}</b></div><div><small>REPRESENTATION</small><b>{data.strategyLabel}</b></div></div><div className="result-spark"><Waveform staticWave/></div><div className="result-meta-bottom"><Badge tone={data.status==='COMPLETED'?'complete':'sim'}><Check size={12}/> {data.status==='COMPLETED'?'Workflow complete':data.statusLabel}</Badge><span title={data.attention.join('\n')||undefined}>{sim?<>Demo data <i>·</i> for research presentation</>:data.attention.length?<>{data.attention.length} item(s) need attention <i>·</i> hover for detail</>:<>Live backend <i>·</i> research output</>}</span></div></Card></div><div className="result-grid"><Card className="transcript-card"><div className="result-card-head"><div><div className="step-label">01 <span>SPEECH TO TEXT</span></div><h2>Transcript analysis</h2></div><button className="collapse-btn" onClick={()=>setExpanded(!expanded)} aria-expanded={expanded}>{expanded?'Collapse':'Expand'} <ChevronDown className={expanded?'':'rotated'} size={15}/></button></div>{expanded&&<><div className="transcript-tools"><label className="search-box"><Search size={15}/><input aria-label="Search transcript" placeholder="Search transcript" value={query} onChange={e=>setQuery(e.target.value)}/></label><span className="confidence-legend"><i/> {sim?'Word confidence ≥ 90%':'Token probability ≥ 90%'}</span><IconButton label="Copy transcript" onClick={()=>{navigator.clipboard?.writeText(transcript.map(x=>x.text).join(' '));setCopied(true);setTimeout(()=>setCopied(false),1600)}}>{copied?<Check size={16}/>:<Copy size={16}/>}</IconButton></div><div className="transcript-lines">{transcript.length?transcript.map((u,i)=><div className="utterance" key={i}><span className="utterance-time">{u.time}</span><p>{u.text.split(' ').map((word,j)=><span key={j} className={highlight(u,word,j)?'highlight-word':''}>{word}{' '}</span>)}{u.flag&&<Badge tone="annotation">{u.flag}</Badge>}</p><span className={`utterance-confidence ${u.confidence!=null&&u.confidence<90?'low':''}`} title={sim?undefined:'Mean Whisper word token probability (uncalibrated)'}>{u.confidence==null?'—':`${u.confidence}%`}</span></div>):<div className="empty-state"><Search size={18}/>{data.transcript.lines.length?'No matching transcript words.':`No transcript · ${(data.transcript.state||'').replaceAll('_',' ')}${data.transcript.message?` — ${data.transcript.message}`:''}`}</div>}</div><div className="transcript-foot"><span>{data.transcript.lines.length} utterance segments{sim?'':` · ${data.transcript.model||'ASR'}${data.transcript.language?` · ${data.transcript.language}`:''}`}</span><span>{data.transcript.note}</span></div></>}</Card><Card className="metrics-card"><div className="result-card-head"><div><div className="step-label">02 <span>CLINICAL LANGUAGE FEATURES</span></div><h2>Feature summary</h2></div><button className="help-link"><Info size={14}/> About metrics</button></div><div className="metric-grid">{data.metrics.map(({label,value:val,explanation,note:change,computed},i)=><div className="metric-item" key={label} style={computed?undefined:{opacity:.55}}><div className="metric-title"><span>{label}</span><button title={explanation} aria-label={`${label}: ${explanation}`}><Info size={12}/></button></div><b>{val}<small>{i===5?'':' '}</small></b><div className="metric-foot"><span>{change}</span><i className={`metric-line m${i%4}`}/></div></div>)}</div><div className="feature-disclaimer"><Info size={13}/> {data.featuresNote}</div></Card></div><Card className="fusion-card"><div className="fusion-header"><div><div className="step-label">03 <span>FEATURE INTEGRATION</span></div><h2>How speech information comes together</h2><p>Two complementary views are aligned into a unified feature representation.{!sim&&data.fusion&&<><br/><small>Live: fusion {data.fusion.state.replaceAll('_',' ').toLowerCase()}{data.fusion.unified_dimension?` · ${data.fusion.unified_dimension}-d ${data.fusion.strategy} vector (${data.fusion.blocks.map(b=>b.name.replace('embedding:','')).join(' + ')})`:''}{data.embeddings.length?` · ${data.embeddings.map(e=>`${e.name}: ${e.state==='COMPUTED'?`${e.dimension}-d`:e.state.replaceAll('_',' ').toLowerCase()}`).join(' · ')}`:''}</small></>}</p></div><Badge tone="soft">CONCEPTUAL ARCHITECTURE</Badge></div><div className="fusion-flow"><div className="fusion-source"><span className="fusion-icon acoustic"><AudioWaveform size={18}/></span><b>Acoustic features</b><small>Speech embeddings</small><div className="feature-chips"><span>Timing</span><span>Pauses</span><span>Fluency</span></div></div><div className="fusion-lines"><i/><i/></div><div className="fusion-mid"><div><span className="fusion-icon"><BrainCircuit size={17}/></span><b>Speech representation</b></div><div><span className="fusion-icon"><FileText size={17}/></span><b>Linguistic features</b></div></div><div className="fusion-lines right"><i/><i/></div><div className="fusion-source"><span className="fusion-icon language"><ScanTextFallback/></span><b>Clinical language</b><small>Transcript-derived features</small><div className="feature-chips"><span>Lexical</span><span>Syntax</span><span>Repetition</span></div></div><div className="fusion-join"><span/></div><div className="fusion-unified"><span className="fusion-icon"><Network size={19}/></span><b>Multimodal fusion</b><small>Unified feature representation</small></div><div className="fusion-result"><ArrowRight size={17}/></div><div className="fusion-prediction"><span className="fusion-icon"><ChartNoAxesCombined size={19}/></span><b>Severity estimate</b><small>+ explainable output</small></div></div></Card><Card className="xai-card"><div className="xai-left"><div className="step-label">04 <span>EXPLAINABILITY</span></div><h2>Why did the model make this prediction?</h2><p>{sim?'Local feature attribution illustrates how a hypothetical model could weigh signals for this sample.':data.xai.available?`${data.xai.method} attribution for the ${data.xai.target||'model output'}: which inputs contributed to the prediction. Describes model behaviour only, not medical causation.`:'Model attributions (SHAP / LIME) are computed only when a real severity prediction exists.'}</p><div className="xai-caveat"><Info size={14}/> XAI describes model behavior; it does not establish medical causation.</div><Button variant="secondary" icon={ArrowRight} onClick={()=>setPage('Reports')}>Open report explanation</Button></div><div className="xai-right"><div className="xai-tabs"><span className="active">LOCAL IMPORTANCE</span><span>GLOBAL CONTEXT</span><Badge tone="sim">{sim?'SIMULATED':data.xai.available?data.xai.method:'NOT AVAILABLE'}</Badge></div>{data.xai.available?data.xai.rows.map(([name,value,type,width])=><div className="importance-row" key={name}><span>{name}</span><div className="importance-track"><i className={type} style={{width:`${width}%`}}/></div><b className={type}>{value}</b></div>):<div className="empty-state"><Info size={18}/>{data.xai.message||'Explanations are not available.'}</div>}<div className="importance-key"><span><i className="pos"/> Increased estimated severity</span><span><i className="neg"/> Decreased estimated severity</span></div></div></Card><footer className="page-footer"><span>Sample {data.id} <i>·</i> {sim?'Mock analysis workflow':'Live backend analysis'}</span><span>{sim?'Results are simulated and not suitable for diagnosis.':'Research output · not suitable for diagnosis.'}</span></footer></div>}
function ScanTextFallback(){return <FileText size={17}/>}
function ReportsPage({result,setPage}){const [printed,setPrinted]=useState(false),[downloadError,setDownloadError]=useState('');const data=result||simulatedResult();const sim=data.simulated,sv=data.severity;const download=async()=>{setDownloadError('');try{await reportService.download(data)}catch(e){setDownloadError(e.message)}};return <div className="page report-page"><div className="page-title-row"><div><div className="eyebrow">RESEARCH OUTPUT <span className="slash">/</span> {sim?'SAMPLE REPORT':data.id}</div><h1>Analysis report</h1><p>A structured summary for research review and prototype demonstration.</p></div><div className="title-actions"><Button variant="secondary" icon={PrinterFallback} onClick={()=>{setPrinted(true);window.print()}}>Export PDF</Button><Button icon={Download} onClick={download}>{sim?'Download summary':'Download PDF report'}</Button></div></div><div className="report-warning"><Info size={15}/><span><b>Research / prototype / clinical decision-support demonstration</b> — Not a clinical diagnosis. {sim?'Simulated outputs are clearly marked.':'Values below come from the live research backend.'}</span></div><div className="report-layout"><Card className="report-document"><div className="report-brand"><Logo/><span>FOUNDATIONSPEECH <b>/ APHASIA</b></span><span className="report-type">RESEARCH PROTOTYPE</span></div><div className="report-rule"/><p className="report-project-title">{formalProjectTitle}</p><div className="report-doc-eyebrow">SPEECH ANALYSIS SUMMARY <span>FS-A / 01</span></div><h2>Aphasia severity<br/><em>assessment report</em></h2><p className="report-doc-lede">Explainable AI-assisted research prototype output</p><div className="report-fields"><div><small>SAMPLE ID</small><b>{data.id}</b></div><div><small>SAMPLE DURATION</small><b>{data.duration}</b></div><div><small>ANALYSIS DATE</small><b>{sim?'24 September 2026':data.analyzedLabel}</b></div><div><small>MODEL STRATEGY</small><b>{sim?'Multi-model representation':data.strategyLabel}</b></div></div>{!sim&&sv.available&&sv.score!=null?<div className="report-score"><span className="section-kicker">{(sv.targetDefinition||'Severity score').toUpperCase()}</span><ScoreFigures sv={sv}/><p className="score-disclosure">{DISCLOSURE}</p><ScoreDetails sv={sv}/><ScoreMeta sv={sv}/></div>:<><div className="report-severity"><div><span className="section-kicker">{sim?'SIMULATED CLASS ESTIMATE':sv.available?(sv.targetDefinition||'Severity score').toUpperCase():'SEVERITY PREDICTION'}</span><b>{sv.available?(sv.score!=null?`${sv.score.toFixed(1)} / 100 · ${sv.label}`:sv.label):'Not available'}</b><small>{sim?'Placeholder prediction — backend not connected':sv.available?(sv.score!=null?(sv.pilot?'PILOT model (small study, text only) · ':'')+(sv.targetDefinition||'Severity score')+' · research model output · not valid for clinical inference on this recording':(sv.message||'Research model output')):`${sv.state} — ${sv.message||''}`}</small></div>{sv.available&&<div className="report-confidence"><span>{sim?'CONFIDENCE':'PREDICTED AQ'}</span><b>{sim?`${sv.confidence}%`:sv.predictedAq?.toFixed(1)}</b></div>}</div>{sv.available&&sv.probabilities&&<><h3>Class probability distribution</h3>{sv.probabilities.map(([l,n])=><div className="report-prob" key={l}><span>{l}</span><div className="probability-track"><i className={l===sv.label?'selected':''} style={{width:`${n}%`}}/></div><b>{n}%</b></div>)}</>}</>}<div className="report-doc-divider"/><h3>{sim?'Summary of illustrative speech features':'Summary of computed speech features'}</h3><div className="report-feature-row">{(sim?[['Fluency','84'],['Lexical diversity','58'],['Pause duration','1.8s'],['Word repetition','12%']]:data.metrics.filter(m=>m.computed).slice(0,4).map(m=>[m.label,m.value])).map(([a,b])=><div key={a}><small>{a}</small><b>{b}</b></div>)}</div><h3>Interpretation and limitations</h3><p className="report-para">This interface demonstrates a proposed workflow combining speech representations, transcript-derived language features, multimodal fusion, and model explanation. {sim?'All values shown in this sample report are simulated for interface demonstration.':'Values in this report were computed by the research backend; no component has been clinically validated. Download the PDF for the full transcript, feature provenance and model status.'}</p><p className="report-para muted">An explainability view describes model behavior and does not establish medical causation. No output should be used to diagnose, treat, or make decisions about a person.</p><div className="report-doc-footer"><span>FoundationSpeech-Aphasia <i>·</i> Research prototype</span><span>Page 01 / 01</span></div></Card><aside className="report-aside"><Card className="aside-card"><span className="section-kicker">REPORT ACTIONS</span><h3>Review and export</h3><p>{sim?'Preview the layout, print a copy, or download a demonstration summary.':'Preview the layout, print a copy, or download the backend-generated PDF report.'}</p><div className="report-action-list"><button onClick={()=>{setPrinted(true);window.print()}}><span><PrinterFallback size={16}/></span><b>Print report</b><ArrowRight size={15}/></button><button onClick={download}><span><Download size={16}/></span><b>{sim?'Download summary':'Download PDF report'}</b><ArrowRight size={15}/></button><button onClick={()=>setPage('Speech analysis')}><span><ChartNoAxesCombined size={16}/></span><b>Return to analysis</b><ArrowRight size={15}/></button></div>{printed&&<div className="success-note"><Check size={13}/> Print dialog opened</div>}{downloadError&&<div className="success-note"><Info size={13}/> {downloadError}</div>}<div className="aside-divider"/><div className="report-disclaimer"><ShieldCheck size={16}/><b>Research use only</b><p>This report is a prototype demonstration, not a certified medical device or substitute for professional judgment.</p></div></Card><Card className="report-aside-info"><div className="note-head"><Info size={15}/> ABOUT THIS REPORT</div><p>{sim?'This sample report uses simulated data. Switch to the live backend and run an analysis to generate a real PDF report.':'The PDF is generated by the research backend (ReportLab) from stored analysis data.'}</p></Card></aside></div><footer className="page-footer"><span>Report template <i>·</i> Research demonstration</span><span>No clinical claims <i>·</i> {sim?'Placeholder values':'Backend values'}</span></footer></div>}
function PrinterFallback(props){return <FileText {...props}/>}
function HistoryPage({setPage,onOpen}){const [query,setQuery]=useState(''),[filter,setFilter]=useState('All status'),[sort,setSort]=useState(false),{live}=useDataMode(),[allRows,setAllRows]=useState(()=>historyRows.map(r=>({...r,simulated:true}))),[loadError,setLoadError]=useState('');useEffect(()=>{let on=true;setLoadError('');analysisService.history().then(r=>{if(on)setAllRows(r)}).catch(e=>{if(on){setAllRows([]);setLoadError(e.message)}});return()=>{on=false}},[live]);const sim=!live;const rows=allRows.filter(r=>(r.id.toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase())||r.model.toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()))&&(filter==='All status'||r.status===filter)).slice().sort((a,b)=>sort?b.date.localeCompare(a.date):a.id.localeCompare(b.id));return <div className="page history-page"><div className="page-title-row"><div><div className="eyebrow">WORKSPACE <span className="slash">/</span> RECORDS</div><h1>Analysis history</h1><p>Review previous prototype sessions and their research outputs.</p></div><Button icon={Plus} onClick={()=>setPage('New analysis')}>New analysis</Button></div><Card className="table-card"><div className="table-toolbar"><label className="search-box"><Search size={15}/><input placeholder="Search by sample ID or model" aria-label="Search history" value={query} onChange={e=>setQuery(e.target.value)}/></label><div className="table-controls"><select aria-label="Filter by status" value={filter} onChange={e=>setFilter(e.target.value)}><option>All status</option>{[...new Set(allRows.map(r=>r.status))].map(s=><option key={s}>{s}</option>)}</select><button className="filter-button" onClick={()=>setSort(!sort)}><Settings2 size={15}/>{sort?'Date: newest':'Sort'}</button></div></div><div className="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Sample ID</th><th>Date</th><th>Duration</th><th>Predicted severity</th><th>Confidence</th><th>Model</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id}><td><button className="table-id" onClick={()=>onOpen(r)}>{r.id}</button></td><td>{r.date}</td><td>{r.duration}</td><td>{r.severity?<><span className={`severity-dot ${short(r.severity)}`}/>{r.severity}</>:<span title="No trained severity model produced a prediction">No prediction</span>}<Badge tone="sim">{r.simulated?'DEMO':(r.severityState||'').replaceAll('_',' ')}</Badge></td><td>{r.confidence}</td><td>{r.model}</td><td><Badge tone={r.status==='Complete'?'complete':'sim'}><Check size={11}/>{r.status}</Badge></td><td><IconButton label={`Open ${r.id}`} onClick={()=>onOpen(r)}><ArrowUpRight size={16}/></IconButton></td></tr>)}</tbody></table>{rows.length===0&&<div className="empty-state"><FolderOpen size={20}/>{loadError?`History unavailable · ${loadError}`:allRows.length?'No analyses match your search.':'No analyses yet. Run a new analysis to create one.'}</div>}</div><div className="table-foot"><span>Showing {rows.length} of {allRows.length} {sim?'demo':'backend'} analyses</span><span>{sim?<>Mock service data <i>·</i> Not real patient records</>:<>Live backend <i>·</i> De-identified analysis IDs only</>}</span></div></Card><div className="history-note"><Info size={14}/> {sim?'Sample records illustrate the intended history interface. They do not represent collected clinical data.':'Records are stored locally (SQLite) under opaque IDs; uploaded audio is not retained.'}</div><footer className="page-footer"><span>Local research workspace</span><span>{sim?<>Sample records <i>·</i> Simulated</>:<>Backend records <i>·</i> Live</>}</span></footer></div>}
function ModelsPage(){const [selected,setSelected]=useState('wav2vec 2.0'),[compare,setCompare]=useState(false),{live}=useDataMode(),[list,setList]=useState(()=>modelData.map(m=>({...m,simulated:true,usable:true}))),[system,setSystem]=useState(null);useEffect(()=>{let on=true;modelService.list().then(l=>{if(on)setList(l)}).catch(()=>{});modelService.system().then(s=>{if(on)setSystem(s)}).catch(()=>{});return()=>{on=false}},[live]);return <div className="page models-page"><div className="page-title-row"><div><div className="eyebrow">RESEARCH <span className="slash">/</span> REPRESENTATIONS</div><h1>Speech model framework</h1><p>Explore candidate speech encoders for a multimodal research workflow.</p></div><Badge tone="prototype"><FlaskConical size={13}/> RESEARCH CONFIGURATION</Badge></div><div className="model-intro"><div><span className="section-kicker">MODEL STRATEGY</span><h2>Represent speech from complementary perspectives.</h2><p>{live?'Status below is reported by the research backend. A model is used only when its weights are installed locally; nothing is downloaded automatically.':'Model selection is configurable in this frontend. No models are loaded and no inference occurs in this prototype.'}</p></div><div className="segmented"><button className={!compare?'active':''} onClick={()=>setCompare(false)}>Single model</button><button className={compare?'active':''} onClick={()=>setCompare(true)}>Multi-model</button></div></div><div className="models-grid">{list.map((m,i)=><Card role="button" tabIndex={0} onKeyDown={e=>e.key==='Enter'&&setSelected(m.name)} className={`model-card ${selected===m.name?'selected':''}`} key={m.name} onClick={()=>setSelected(m.name)}><div className="model-card-top"><span className="model-symbol"><BrainCircuit size={18}/></span><Badge tone={m.usable?'complete':'sim'}><span className="live-dot"/>{m.status}</Badge></div><div className="model-index">0{i+1} <i>/ SPEECH ENCODER</i></div><h3>{m.name}</h3><span className="model-tag">{m.tag}</span><p>{m.desc}{!m.simulated&&<><br/><small>{m.modelId}{m.dimension?` · ${m.dimension}-d${m.dimensionExpected?" (expected)":""}`:''}{m.device?` · ${m.device}`:''}{m.reason?` · ${m.reason}`:''}</small></>}</p><div className="embedding-line"><span>EMBEDDING REPRESENTATION</span><b><i/>{m.usable?(compare?'Included':'Available'):'Not installed'}</b></div><div className="model-card-foot"><span>{selected===m.name?'Selected':'Select model'}</span>{selected===m.name?<Check size={15}/>:<ArrowRight size={15}/>}</div></Card>)}</div><Card className="comparison-card"><div className="result-card-head"><div><div className="step-label">REPRESENTATION OPTIONS</div><h2>{compare?'Multi-model representation':'Single-model configuration'}</h2></div><Badge tone="soft">CONFIGURABLE</Badge></div><p>{compare?'A proposed fusion workflow may combine embeddings from complementary speech encoders before downstream language and severity analysis.':'A single selected encoder can provide speech representations for the downstream research workflow.'}{live?' In a live analysis the strategy chosen on the New analysis page is sent to the backend; unavailable models are reported, never substituted.':' This choice is a frontend setting only; no inference is run here.'}</p>{system&&<p><small>ASR: {system.asr.engine} {system.asr.model} ({system.asr.status}) · Severity classifier: {system.severity_classifier.state}{system.severity_classifier.reason?` — ${system.severity_classifier.reason}`:''} · Explainability: {system.explainability.status.replace('_',' ')} · Device: {system.hardware.device}</small></p>}<div className="compare-flow">{(compare?['wav2vec 2.0','HuBERT','Whisper Encoder','WavLM']: [selected]).map((name,i)=><React.Fragment key={name}><div className="compare-node"><BrainCircuit size={16}/><span>{name}</span><small>Representation</small></div>{i<(compare?3:0)&&<span className="compare-plus">+</span>}</React.Fragment>)}<ArrowRight size={16}/><div className="compare-node fusion"><Network size={16}/><span>{compare?'Combined feature space':'Selected representation'}</span><small>Proposed research input</small></div></div></Card><footer className="page-footer"><span>Candidate encoders <i>·</i> Research overview</span><span>{live?'Model status reported by backend':'Model status is illustrative'}</span></footer></div>}
function ResearchPage(){const stages=[['01','Speech signal','Audio input'],['02','Foundation models','wav2vec · HuBERT · WavLM'],['03','Clinical language analysis','Transcript & linguistic features'],['04','Multimodal fusion','Acoustic + linguistic'],['05','Transformer classifier','Severity class estimate'],['06','Explainable AI','Local & global attribution']];return <div className="page research-page"><div className="research-hero"><div className="eyebrow"><span className="eyebrow-line"/> RESEARCH FRAMEWORK <span className="slash">/</span> CONCEPT OVERVIEW</div><h1>Building a clearer view<br/>of <em>speech and language.</em></h1><p className="research-formal-title">{formalProjectTitle}</p><p>FoundationSpeech-Aphasia explores an explainable, multimodal approach to aphasia severity assessment. This prototype visualizes a research concept; it does not demonstrate validated model performance.</p><Badge tone="prototype"><FlaskConical size={13}/> ACADEMIC RESEARCH PROTOTYPE</Badge><div className="research-hero-art"><Waveform staticWave/><span>Speech signal <i>→</i> inspectable features</span></div></div><div className="research-content"><div className="research-section-heading"><div><div className="eyebrow">PROPOSED ARCHITECTURE</div><h2>A modular path from signal to explanation.</h2></div><span>PARTLY IMPLEMENTED, NOT VALIDATED</span></div><div className="architecture-list">{stages.map(([n,title,desc],i)=><div className="architecture-row" key={n}><span className="architecture-num">{n}</span><div className="architecture-node"><span className="arch-icon">{[<AudioWaveform/>,<BrainCircuit/>,<FileText/>,<Network/>,<ChartNoAxesCombined/>,<Sparkles/>][i]}</span><div><b>{title}</b><small>{desc}</small></div></div>{i<stages.length-1&&<ChevronDown className="arch-chevron" size={15}/>}<span className="arch-state">{STAGE_MATURITY[i]}</span></div>)}</div><div className="research-columns"><Card className="research-text-card"><span className="section-kicker">RESEARCH MOTIVATION</span><h3>Make complementary evidence easier to inspect.</h3><p>Aphasia can affect multiple aspects of communication. Research into automatic severity assessment has included handcrafted acoustic measures and conventional classifiers. FoundationSpeech-Aphasia presents a proposed interface for exploring speech foundation model representations alongside transcript-derived clinical language features.</p><p>The concept combines acoustic and linguistic evidence through multimodal fusion, then surfaces a severity estimate with feature-level explanations for research review.</p></Card><Card className="research-text-card"><span className="section-kicker">SCOPE AND LIMITATIONS</span><h3>Research tool concept. Clinical claims require evidence.</h3><ul><li>Simulated mode: all predictions and metrics are demonstration data.</li><li>Live mode: preprocessing, ASR, language features and embeddings run; no severity classifier has been trained or validated.</li><li>Explainability views describe model behavior, not medical causation.</li><li>Any future clinical use would require rigorous validation and oversight.</li></ul><div className="xai-caveat"><ShieldCheck size={14}/> This is not a certified medical device.</div></Card></div><div className="approach-strip"><div><span>INPUT</span><b>Speech sample</b></div><ArrowRight size={15}/><div><span>REPRESENTATIONS</span><b>Foundation models</b></div><ArrowRight size={15}/><div><span>ANALYSIS</span><b>Features + fusion</b></div><ArrowRight size={15}/><div><span>OUTPUT</span><b>Explained estimate</b></div></div></div><footer className="page-footer"><span>FoundationSpeech-Aphasia <i>·</i> Research framework</span><span>Proposed architecture <i>·</i> Not clinically validated</span></footer></div>}
